{title: Victory Shall Be Mine}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Victory, victory shall be [G]mine,
[G]Victory, victory shall be [D]mine.[D][C][B][A]
If I [G]hold my [B]peace,
Let the [C]Lord fight my [Db]battles;
I [D]know that the victory shall be [G]mine,

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]Victory, victory shall be [G]mine,
[G]Victory, victory shall be [D]mine.[D][C][B][A]
If I [G]walk up-[B]right,
All my [C]battles He will [Db]fight;
I [D]know that the victory shall be [G]mine,
